    "body": "I implemented an function for calculating the variance of the loss (has to be implemented manually for each loss).\r\nShots can be obtained by (beta: hyperparmeter)\r\n```\r\nshots = int(np.divide(loss_var,np.square(loss_value)*np.square(beta)))\r\nnum_shots = min(max(shots,min_shots),max_shots)\r\n```",
